      "name": "GetBNGatewayAccessInstance",
      "signature": "BNGatewayAccess * GetBNGatewayAccessInstance(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined *",
      "comment": "Get singleton instance of BNGatewayAccess and ensure initialization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call BNGatewayAccess::LoadBNGatewayDataAndValidate() to initialize gateway list\n2. Return pointer to global BNGatewayAccess instance at 0x6ff3e9f0\n\nParameters:\n  (None)\n\nReturns:\n  BNGatewayAccess*: Pointer to initialized global gateway access object\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - First call triggers gateway list loading from \"Data\\Global\\Realms.bin\"\n  - Subsequent calls return cached instance without reloading\n  - Instance pointer is at fixed address 0x6ff3e9f0",
