      "name": "SetFilePosition",
      "signature": "uint SetFilePosition(uint dwFileHandle, int nDistanceLow, int * pnDistanceHigh, uint dwMoveMethod)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Wrapper for SetFilePointer via Storm Ordinal_271.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Forwards all parameters to Storm's SetFilePointer wrapper\n2. Returns the new file position or INVALID_SET_FILE_POINTER on error\n\nParameters:\n- dwFileHandle (uint): Handle to the open file\n- nDistanceLow (int): Low 32 bits of distance to move\n- pnDistanceHigh (int*): Pointer to high 32 bits of distance (in/out), or NULL\n- dwMoveMethod (uint): Starting point (0=FILE_BEGIN, 1=FILE_CURRENT, 2=FILE_END)\n\nReturns:\n- Low DWORD of new file pointer position\n- INVALID_SET_FILE_POINTER (0xFFFFFFFF) on failure",
