      "name": "InitializeProcessInformation",
      "signature": "void InitializeProcessInformation(_PROCESS_INFORMATION * pProcessInfo)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize PROCESS_INFORMATION structure to all zeroes\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear hProcess handle field (offset 0x0)\n2. Clear hThread handle field (offset 0x4)\n3. Clear dwProcessId field (offset 0x8)\n4. Clear dwThreadId field (offset 0xc)\n\nParameters:\npProcessInfo (_PROCESS_INFORMATION *) - Pointer to process information structure to initialize\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name    | Type   | Description\n-------|------|---------------|--------|---------------------------\n0x0    | 4    | hProcess      | HANDLE | Process handle (cleared to NULL)\n0x4    | 4    | hThread       | HANDLE | Thread handle (cleared to NULL)\n0x8    | 4    | dwProcessId   | DWORD  | Process identifier (cleared to 0)\n0xc    | 4    | dwThreadId    | DWORD  | Thread identifier (cleared to 0)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.10",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:cc80bc73a373b0bee91742ce5c266d40",
