      "name": "InitializeSystemLocaleInfo",
      "signature": "void InitializeSystemLocaleInfo(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initialize system locale and timezone information for application startup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize TIME_ZONE_INFORMATION structure (43 DWORDs = 172 bytes) with zeros\n2. Call GetTimeZoneInformation to populate timezone data with current system settings\n3. Call GetSystemTime to retrieve current UTC system time\n4. Call GetLocalTime to retrieve current local system time\n5. Convert UTC system time to FILETIME format using SystemTimeToFileTime\n6. Convert local time to FILETIME format using SystemTimeToFileTime\n7. Extract and store timezone bias (Bias field) from TIME_ZONE_INFORMATION\n8. Call GetSystemDefaultLCID to get system default locale identifier\n9. Call GetUserDefaultLCID to get user default locale identifier\n10. Call GetUserDefaultLangID to get user default language identifier\n11. Call GetLocaleInfoA with LOCALE_SDATE (3) to retrieve date separator string\n12. Scan date separator buffer to find null terminator, append next locale string\n13. Call GetLocaleInfoA with LOCALE_STIME (5) to retrieve time separator string\n14. Scan time separator buffer to find null terminator, append next locale string\n15. Call GetLocaleInfoA with LOCALE_SDECIMAL (7) to retrieve decimal separator string\n16. Scan decimal separator buffer to find null terminator, append next locale string\n17. Call GetLocaleInfoA with ID 0x1002 to retrieve additional locale information\n18. Scan additional locale data to determine total buffer length\n19. Calculate final locale buffer size from base address to end of data\n20. Call function at 0x6ff2eb00 with locale buffer pointer and size 0x12 (18 bytes)\n\nParameters:\nNone - function accesses system state via Windows API calls\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- LOCALE_USER_DEFAULT constant is 0x400\n- GetLocaleInfoA buffer size for each section is 0x40 (64 bytes)\n- String scanning loops scan across multiple concatenated locale strings\n- TIME_ZONE_INFORMATION requires 43 DWORD zero initialization (not standard size)",
