      "name": "DispatchIterationCallbacks",
      "signature": "void DispatchIterationCallbacks(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Dispatches initialization and iteration callbacks on news collection.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load and call initialization callback if registered (non-null at 0x6ff3f640)\n2. Load iteration callback pointer from 0x6ff3f63c\n3. If iteration callback is null, skip processing and exit\n4. Load collection end pointer (0x6ff3f8d0) and start pointer (0x6ff3f8dc)\n5. Calculate item count: end - start (must be positive)\n6. If count <= 0, skip loop and exit\n7. Load metadata offset from 0x6ff3f8d4\n8. For each item in collection (count times):\n   - Calculate item pointer using stride 0x408 (1032 bytes per structure)\n   - Load metadata from [base + offset - 4] into ECX\n   - Calculate item data from [base + offset] into EDX\n   - Call iteration callback with ECX, EDX parameters\n   - Decrement item count and continue until all items processed\n9. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nNone. Function uses global callback pointers and collection state variables.\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early if initialization callback is null (0x6ff3f640 contains nullptr)\n- Skips iteration if callback null (0x6ff3f63c) or collection empty\n- Collection uses reverse iteration (from end downward)\n- Item stride is fixed at 0x408 (1032) bytes\n- Iteration callback invoked via CALL [0x6ff3f63c] indirect call\n\nGlobal State Variables:\n- g_pfnNewsInitCallback (0x6ff3f640): Function pointer to init callback\n- g_pfnNewsIterationCallback (0x6ff3f63c): Function pointer to per-item callback\n- g_dwNewsCollectionEnd (0x6ff3f8d0): End marker for collection\n- g_dwNewsCollectionStart (0x6ff3f8dc): Start marker for collection\n- g_dwNewsMetadataOffset (0x6ff3f8d4): Offset to metadata within each item",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
