      "name": "DispatchPacketHandler",
      "signature": "uint DispatchPacketHandler(byte byPacketType)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Dispatches packet handler callback based on packet type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize return value to 0\n2. Validate packet type < 0x5E (94 decimal)\n3. Calculate handler table index: type * 4 bytes\n4. Load handler pointer from g_pPacketHandlerTable[type]\n5. Check if handler is non-NULL\n6. Call handler if exists and store result\n7. Mark packet type as dispatched (flag = 1)\n8. Return handler result or 0 if invalid/NULL\n\nParameters:\n- packetType (byte CL): Packet type ID, valid range 0-0x5D\n\nReturns:\n- uint: Handler return value or 0 if invalid type/no handler",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
