      "name": "ProcessConnectionCommand",
      "signature": "int ProcessConnectionCommand(uint * pCommandData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Process connection commands via jump table dispatcher.\nReads command code from input parameter, dispatches to handler.\nSupports 7 command types: 0 (init), 3 (connect), 4 (hash+store), 5 (auth), 6 (complete).\nAlgorithm: Load command from pCommandData[0], init buffers, bounds check code<=6, dispatch.\nEach handler may call SetConnectionState for state transitions or compute MD5 hash.\nCommands 4 and 6 hash 256 bytes (0x100) from pCommandData[1] into g_CommandHashBuffer.\nParameters: pCommandData (uint*) - array with command code at [0], data at [1..n].\nReturns: int - always 1 (success).\nSpecial: Out-of-range commands bypass dispatch. Uses __fastcall (pCommandData in ECX).\nGlobals: g_dwCurrentCommandCode, g_CommandHashBuffer, g_dwConnectionInitialized.",
