      "name": "DispatchGameObjectCommand",
      "signature": "uint DispatchGameObjectCommand(CommandRequest * pCommandRequest, uint dwBufferSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Dispatch and execute game object commands based on request type and buffer validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that buffer size exceeds minimum threshold of 0x43 (67 bytes)\n2. Load command type value from request structure offset +0x0\n3. Test if command type equals 0 for cryptographic state initialization path\n4. Test if command type equals 1 for global state initialization with standard parameter\n5. Test if command type equals 5 for export game object with validation\n6. Execute error initialization path with parameter 0x12 for all other command types\n7. Return appropriate status code from executed command handler\n\nParameters:\n  pCommandRequest - Pointer to CommandRequest structure (ECX register) containing command data and object information\n  dwBufferSize - Size of command request buffer in bytes (EDX register), must exceed 0x43 threshold\n\nReturns:\n  uint - Result code: 0 for buffer validation failure or unknown command, 1 for command type 1 success, or result from called function\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  0x43: Minimum valid buffer size (67 bytes required for dispatch)\n  0xd: Parameter for standard global state initialization\n  0x12: Parameter for error condition global state initialization",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:2b795152d04b28edb81c145fad4d2bdb",
