      "name": "InitializeGameStateManager",
      "signature": "uint InitializeGameStateManager(uint dwGameInstanceHandle, int nInitMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes or cleans up the game state manager and critical section.\nHandles three operational modes for game state initialization.\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load initMode parameter value from stack\n2. Check if initMode equals 0 for cleanup mode operation\n3. If cleanup: call DeleteCriticalSection on g_BattleNetCriticalSection\n4. Check if initMode equals 1 for full initialization mode operation\n5. If init: zero g_dwGameStateVar1, g_dwGameStateVar2, g_dwGameStateVar3\n6. Call InitializeCriticalSection on g_BattleNetCriticalSection\n7. In all modes: store dwGameInstanceHandle to g_dwGameInstanceHandle\n8. Return 1 indicating successful completion to caller\nParameters:\ndwGameInstanceHandle (uint): Game instance identifier for tracking\nnInitMode (int): Mode selection (0=cleanup, 1=initialize, other=default)\nReturns:\n1 (uint): Success indicator returned in EAX register",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
