      "name": "VerifyGameFilesWithRevisionCheck",
      "signature": "int VerifyGameFilesWithRevisionCheck(uint * pOutVersion1, uint * pOutVersion2, byte * pOutResult)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Verify game files against revision check server and extract version information.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize output parameters (pOutVersion1, pOutVersion2, pOutResult) to zero if not NULL\n2. Setup timeout loop with 20-second (0x4e20ms) maximum wait\n3. Poll for version file (ver-IX86-1.mpq) availability with 10ms sleep intervals\n4. Once file detected, open MPQ file using OpenMpqFile API\n5. Extract version information from MPQ using GetMPQFileVersion\n6. If version is 0 or >= 5, download revision checker DLL from remote server\n7. Load downloaded DLL into memory using LoadLibraryA\n8. Retrieve CheckRevision export function using GetProcAddress\n9. Compute MD5 hashes of three data sources:\n   - Main executable file (full path)\n   - bnclient.dll file (after removing directory path)\n   - d2client.dll file (after removing directory path)\n10. Call CheckRevision function with computed hashes and validation string\n11. Free loaded DLL and close MPQ file\n12. Delete temporary files (MPQ and DLL)\n13. Return CheckRevision result (0=success, 1=timeout, other=error)\n\nParameters:\n  pOutVersion1: Pointer to UINT receiving major version (set to 0 if NULL)\n  pOutVersion2: Pointer to UINT receiving minor version (set to 0 if NULL)\n  pOutResult: Pointer to BYTE receiving verification result (set to 0 if NULL)\n\nReturns:\n  0: Verification succeeded\n  1: File not found within 20-second timeout\n  Other: Error from CheckRevision function or API call failures\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Version file search timeout is 20 seconds (0x4e20ms) with 10ms poll interval\n  - Sleep 50ms (0x32) after cleanup before returning\n  - Temporary files are always deleted regardless of success/failure\n  - NULL output parameters are safely handled without dereferencing\n  - Invalid version (0 or >= 5) triggers automatic DLL download\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset  Size  Field Name                Type      Description\n  0x0     4     szVersionHashData         byte[260] Hash buffer (256 bytes + padding)\n  0x100   4     hMpqFile                  UINT      MPQ file handle (0 if closed)\n  0x104   4     checkRevisionResult       INT       Return value from CheckRevision\n  0x108   260   szCheckRevisionDllPath    char[260] Path to downloaded DLL file",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
