      "name": "ConvertStringAndGenerateRandomData",
      "signature": "bool ConvertStringAndGenerateRandomData(char * szInputString)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Converts a UTF-8 string to wide character format, validates the conversion, and generates cryptographic random data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input string pointer is not NULL; return false if null\n2. Calculate the length of the input UTF-8 string using manual byte iteration\n3. Return false if the calculated string length is 0 (empty string check)\n4. Call DispatchToTranslateBytesViaLookupTable to convert UTF-8 to wide character (UTF-16) format, with maximum buffer size 0x1FF (511 characters)\n5. Check if the UTF-8 to UTF-16 conversion succeeded (conversion length > 0); return false if conversion failed\n6. Null-terminate the wide character buffer at offset (conversionLength * 2)\n7. Call ConvertUtf16ToUtf8Thunk to validate the conversion by converting the wide character data back to UTF-8 for verification\n8. Check the validation conversion result; return false if validation failed (result != 0)\n9. Null-terminate the UTF-8 validation buffer at the conversion length offset\n10. Call GenerateCryptographicRandomData to generate exactly 0xE (14) bytes of cryptographic random data into the validation buffer\n11. Return the success status (true if random generation succeeded with EAX >= 0, false otherwise)\n\nParameters:\npInputString - Pointer to a null-terminated UTF-8 encoded input string; must not be NULL\n\nReturns:\ntrue if the string conversion and cryptographic random data generation both succeeded\nfalse if any step fails: NULL input, empty string, UTF-8 to UTF-16 conversion failure, validation failure, or random data generation failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Empty strings (length == 0) are rejected with false return\n- Maximum buffer size for wide character conversion is 0x1FF (511 characters)\n- Exactly 14 bytes (0xE) of cryptographic random data are generated\n- Validation step ensures round-trip conversion integrity (UTF-8 -> UTF-16 -> UTF-8)\n- Uses __fastcall convention with input string pointer passed in ECX register\n\nStructure Layout:\nStack Frame (0x604 bytes total):\nOffset  Size  Field Name              Type          Description\n------  ----  --------------------    ----------    -------------------------------------------\n-0x600  512   utf8ValidationBuffer    char[512]     Buffer for UTF-8 validation conversion and random data\n-0x400  512   wideCharBuffer          wchar_t[512]  Buffer for UTF-16 wide character conversion",
