      "comment": "Initializes Battle.net gateway configuration and validates connection parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 256-byte stack buffer for gateway configuration data\n2. Load Battle.net gateway access configuration from persistent storage via\n   LoadBNGatewayDataAndValidate(g_pBNetGatewayAccessBase)\n3. Retrieve gateway host entry using GetNthGatewayEntry with gateway index\n   stored in g_dwBNetGatewayIndex\n4. Compute MD5 hash of gateway host data via MD5HashData(pMD5HashOutput,\n   pSourceData, hashDataSize) for verification\n5. Construct gateway configuration dispatcher call with:\n   - Diablo II identifier string (szDiabloIIIdentifier)\n   - BNETIP server address string (szBNetIPServer)\n   - Mode flags set to 0\n   - Local configuration buffer (gatewayConfigBuffer)\n   - Buffer size 0x100 (256 bytes)\n6. Dispatch gateway configuration to system via BNetGatewayDispatcher\n7. Clear EAX return value via XOR (code after is unreachable artifact)\n8. Deallocate 256-byte stack buffer and return to caller\n\nParameters:\n  Implicit ESI: pMD5HashOutput (pointer to hash output buffer passed from caller)\n  Implicit EDI: hashDataSize (size of data to hash passed from caller)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Function initializes gateway configuration as side effect\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - 256-byte stack buffer allocated for configuration data storage\n  - Gateway access base address g_pBNetGatewayAccessBase manages gateway table\n  - Gateway index g_dwBNetGatewayIndex selects specific gateway entry\n  - MD5 hash computed for gateway data verification and authentication\n  - XOR at 0x6ff2f406 clears EAX but subsequent JZ is unreachable (optimization)\n  - Function uses __stdcall calling convention with callee cleanup\n  - Called once per download thread initialization from DownloadFileFromSocketThread\n  - Diablo II identifier and BNETIP server name hardcoded in string constants",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
