      "name": "GetNthGatewayEntry",
      "signature": "char * GetNthGatewayEntry(BNGatewayAccess * this, int nIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Retrieves a pointer to the Nth null-terminated string entry from a BNGatewayAccess string array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that the string data pointer exists and index is within valid range (1 to max index)\n2. Calculate target iteration count as (nIndex * 3) to iterate through string entries\n3. Loop through each string entry, skipping null terminators, until reaching the target iteration\n4. For each iteration: check that accumulated offset doesn't exceed buffer limit, get string length using strlen(), advance pointer past string and null terminator\n5. After loop completes, verify we stayed within buffer bounds and iteration count is valid\n6. If all validations pass, return pointer to the Nth entry; otherwise return base structure pointer\n7. On any validation failure (null pointer, invalid index, bounds exceeded), return base structure pointer\n\nParameters:\n- this: Pointer to BNGatewayAccess structure containing string data\n- nIndex: 1-based index of the string entry to retrieve (must be >= 1 and <= max_index)\n\nReturns:\n- char*: Pointer to the Nth null-terminated string if index is valid and within bounds; otherwise returns (char*)this as error indicator\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If string data pointer is null, returns (char*)this\n- If index is 0 or negative, returns (char*)this\n- If index exceeds max_index, returns (char*)this\n- If accumulated offset exceeds buffer limit during iteration, returns (char*)this early\n- String entries are separated by null terminators; each iteration counts one string plus separator\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field              Type      Description\n0x00    4     (unknown)          void*     [reserved]\n0x04    4     (unknown)          void*     [reserved]\n0x08    4     nMaxIndex          int       Maximum valid index value\n0x10    4     pStringData        char*     Pointer to packed string array buffer\n0x14    4     nBufferSize        int       Total buffer size limit in bytes",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
