      "name": "GetSystemTimeZone",
      "signature": "int GetSystemTimeZone(BNGatewayAccess * this)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Retrieves system timezone bias with Korean locale handling.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Allocate stack buffer for TIME_ZONE_INFORMATION\\n2. Initialize buffer to zero\\n3. Get timezone info from system registry\\n4. Get user's language ID\\n5. Extract primary language code (mask 0x3FF)\\n6. Check if Korean language (0x9)\\n7. If Korean, check sublanguage (mask 0xFC00)\\n8. If not Korean or sublanguage wrong, use default 0x1E0\\n9. If both conditions met, load Bias from structure\\n10. Return timezone bias value\\n\\nParameters:\\nthis - BNGatewayAccess object (ECX, __thiscall)\\n\\nReturns:\\nint - Timezone bias (minutes), or 0x1E0 for Korean",
